<title>UK: BayerVB sets 750 mln French franc step-up bond. [CORRECTED 16:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets 750 mln French franc step-up bond. [CORRECTED 16:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Lyonnais.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    750 MLN FFR   COUPON    *5.40	MATURITY    25.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.97     PAY DATE    25.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    99.97     LISTING     LUX/PAR</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO YEAR FIVE, THEN STEPS UP TO 7.40 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>(Corrects Moody's rating from AA2 TO AA1).</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
